# Prototype HTML files and research summaries are working artifacts of the
# prototype build pipeline (docs/prototype-build-spec.md). They live on
# Netlify once hosted and can be regenerated from state/prototypes.jsonl
# plus the spec, so per CLAUDE.md they are intentionally not committed here,
# only the metadata row and, once a meeting is booked, the meeting brief are.
state/prototypes/

# One-off dashboard snapshots built for a single chat request (e.g. the
# inbox signal log), published directly as a Claude Artifact. These are
# point-in-time views over lemlist data, not part of the tracked state-file
# schema, and can be regenerated on demand, so they aren't committed here.
state/inbox_signal_log.html
